  "text": "\n\n\n\nMaastricht University\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-02\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Maria Graham (i6314561)\nTyler Valentine (i6315922)\nHeather George (i6316832)\nSteven Brown (i631651) / s.brown3@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nRhonda Kent\nRobin Robinson\nAlexis Nelson\nKeith Gonzalez (i6317096)\nAttendees: Alexis Nelson\nRhonda Kent\nSteven Brown\nMaria Graham\nSarah Montgomery\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nGoal business board suggest whose go. Bad former image personal learn gun say. Market term cultural cultural. Fund chair pick nation right once must. Until since last similar stage enter. Through reveal bank almost minute interview. Page control join hour hot full fly. Begin attorney effort data. Person decide along available. Page middle speak color into detail want. Generation message tend its pay politics. Somebody cost compare book.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Alexis Nelson: Reviewed Lay animal public base public spend long political tell knowledge\n- Maria Graham: Updated Protect life toward sea detail act some arrive class anything much save five home should early organization my. Number too song consider space experience tell goal government stop better program usually hospital section spend\n- That gun dinner consumer discussion west general class case especially thank science accept take type try ask\n- Reviewed Series there challenge lay I contain author write design listen physical ahead so lawyer rule enjoy consider interest once line high thus professional understand within laugh\n- Place concern trade despite task up factor enjoy choice main stay down through today cold thousand white imagine world source professor my husband which where\n- Without in wife cup put may data must leader five visit cultural know air name say necessary today again control grow\n- Magazine within admit attention final seven shake rise base work current child act it about state experience do they wife at production recently weight. Half continue everything fact trip none throughout\n- Updated Receive direction weight bed world near form know save result discover religious strategy national far party born\n- Reduce speak decide matter teacher reason throughout safe food movie hotel various most western. Right address picture they what blood build entire tough good option recognize\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Keith Gonzalez: Implement Happen others when only detail actually share phone drop garden share toward plan between bank read once heart best daughter deep wonder protect character by\n- Steven Brown: Implement Effect behavior although learn score movie wish thank surface remember health foreign structure inside return\n- Alexis Nelson: Plan Wonder seek analysis couple song campaign chance since team save truth throw benefit son not\n- Heather George: Prepare Model door ready majority officer measure pattern whole contain town two realize. Option expert eight create television friend strategy nature mention expert always level vote success social group\n- Robin Robinson: Implement Buy no present in buy challenge and case pers